{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23641","headline":"赠楚州郭使君 · 白居易","name":"赠楚州郭使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮水东南第一州，山围雉堞月当楼。\n黄金印绶悬腰底，白雪歌诗落笔头。\n笑看儿童骑竹马，醉携宾客上仙舟。\n当家美事堆身上，何啻林宗与细侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}